penetrator-level 1
seed 0
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# example.pen - a short hand-written mission, kept as a worked example of the
# level format. Copy it to levels/custom.pen to fly it from the menu, or open
# it in the editor with CTRL+O once copied.
#
# Heights are absolute screen y in the 480x270 virtual canvas: "ceil" is the
# underside of the rock above and "floor" is the top of the rock below, one
# value per 8-unit column. Spawn coordinates are relative to the start of the
# zone they appear in.
#
# This file obeys the same two rules the generator does. The cave never narrows
# below about 78 units on the route to the warhead, and neither surface moves
# more than 8.5 units between adjacent columns - which at this zone's scroll
# speed is inside what the ship can climb. Break either rule and you get a
# level that looks fine and cannot be flown.
#
# The last fourteen columns close to nothing on purpose. That is the back wall
# of the chamber, and it sits behind the objective, so it never blocks the
# route.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

zone "DEMO RUN" scroll 110 palette 0
